OL,3,GNEWSAFunding pledged to move road at   
OL,4,Arisk of collapse                       
OL,6,FGovernment funding has been pledged to 
OL,7,Fhelp move a road at risk of collapse   
OL,8,Fdue to coastal erosion.                
OL,10,FCowbar Lane, the main road into the    
OL,11,Fnorth side of the coastal village of   
OL,12,FStaithes, is eroding from waves and    
OL,13,Fheavy rain, a report previously found. 
OL,15,FThe Department for Environment, Food   
OL,16,Fand Rural Affairs (Defra) announced    
OL,17,F#870,000 investment to support moving  
OL,18,Fthe road and for digital coastal       
OL,19,Fmonitoring technology.                 
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
