OL,3,GNEWSAFunding pledged to move road at   
OL,4,Arisk of collapse                       
OL,6,FLabour MP for Middlesbrough South and  
OL,7,FEast Cleveland Luke Myer welcomed the  
OL,8,Ffunding and said the area could not    
OL,9,Fafford to lose the carriageway.        
